  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Why is Mania Dash unfinished?

    Unity''s editor is HORRIBLE for making
    these auto-scroll sections. It started taking me SO long to make any progress
    in these sections that I would be stalled for MONTHS on milliseconds worth of
    gameplay. Makes you grateful for the conviniences of the GD editor.


    Most
    important of those being:

    - Automatic start position music sync

    - Fast
    play-testing iteration time (+ easy start pos obj)

    - Object placement on
    grid'
